<h1 style="font-size:clamp(36px,5.5vw,64px)">Which night is <span class="acc">whose.</span></h1>
<p class="lead">The NBA's national TV deal splits the week between NBC/Peacock, ESPN/ABC and Prime Video. When your team plays a national game, it's on that network instead of your local channel.</p>
{% include "week.njk" %}
<div class="sec"><h2>Good to know</h2></div>
<div class="dec">
<div class="dc"><span class="n">FREE</span><h3>NBC and ABC</h3><p>Both are free with an antenna anywhere in the US. NBC has 100 games this season across NBC, Peacock and NBCSN.</p></div>
<div class="dc"><span class="n">STREAM</span><h3>Peacock and Prime</h3><p>Peacock Monday games also air on NBCSN. Prime Video games need a Prime membership.</p></div>
<div class="dc"><span class="n">NOT EXCLUSIVE</span><h3>NBA TV</h3><p>NBA TV games still air on the teams' local channels in their home markets.</p></div>
